# Every printer with its status and whether it is the default (D83,
# SPEC-QUESTIONS T3-1). Run after tools/windows-state.ps1 on a CI runner:
# printers idle, paused, paused with a job, working offline, with a failed
# job, on an unreachable port, and a default one.
get system information "printers" into printers
for each printer in printers
    say name of printer "|" status of printer "|" isDefault of printer
.
say length of printers "printers"
